# Spec 039 (REQ-039-04, 05), ADR-0037: every environment variable of the API and of its database stack, and where the
# deployment writes it from the GitHub Environment `production`. tools/check-docs.mjs (workspace) checks that these
# names are exactly the ones of docs/api/configuration.md. Format: deploy/render-env.mjs.
#
# file           name                        source    need
.env             POSTGRES_DB                 var       required
.env             POSTGRES_USER               var       required
.env             POSTGRES_PASSWORD           secret    required
.env             API_KEY                     secret    required
.env             HYPIXEL_API_KEY             secret    required
.env             WEBHOOK_SECRET              secret    required
.env             API_IMAGE                   workflow  required
deploy/db/.env   POSTGRES_DB                 var       required
deploy/db/.env   POSTGRES_USER               var       required
deploy/db/.env   POSTGRES_PASSWORD           secret    required
deploy/db/.env   BACKUP_DIR                  var       optional
deploy/db/.env   KEEP                        var       optional
deploy/db/.env   OFFSITE_COMMAND             secret    optional
-                WEBHOOK_URL                 none      read by the dev profile only (the local bot)
-                SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL       none      set by docker-compose.yml from POSTGRES_*
-                SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME  none      set by docker-compose.yml from POSTGRES_*
-                SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD  none      set by docker-compose.yml from POSTGRES_*
-                SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE      none      set to prod by docker-compose.yml
-                APP_COMMIT                  none      set in the image by the CI (build argument)
-                DB_CONTAINER                none      used by the tests of the database scripts only
-                ENV_FILE                    none      used by the tests of the database scripts only
